@description Rea-Sixty
@author Frank Acklin
@version 0.1.9
@changelog
  - Knob travel works on stepped params now (UF8 V-Pots Plugin Mode + focused CS/BC, UC1 CS/BC knobs, UC1 EXT_FUNCS). Sensitivity = "Detent speed": 1.0x = 2 detents per step, 2.0x = 1 per detent, 4.0x = 2 steps per detent. Shift = Fine quarters on top.
  - Stepped params: Min/Max snap to step grid; push reset snaps to nearest step; curve editor swaps to info line when bound param is stepped.
  - New "Set" button next to Min/Max in the curve editor right-click menu: snaps that range edge to the plug-in's current parameter value. Dial the FX to where you want the bound, click Set.
  - Curve editor right-click Min/Max rows now align pixel-perfect (4-col table: label / slider / input / Set).
  - Sensitivity row in curve editor popup: single-row layout (label above, slider + input + 1x reset below).
  - UC1 Encoder 2: ticksPerStep 2 -> 3, fixes double-stepping on fast turns.
  - UC1 track delete: focus snaps to the track directly above the deleted one (not project track 1). Carousel + zone 0x02 refresh immediately.
  - Instance Cycle: focused slotIdx preserved when target instance has the same LinkSlot. No more reset to slot 0 / Bypass on every cycle step.
  - tickStepped sens floor 0.1 -> 0.001 so Shift-Fine at slider min still slows further.
  - Curve editor popup 380 -> 390 px height.
